github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T06:16:40Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T06:16:40Z","body":"Interesting idea, amazing work! :)\n\nBut may I ask what's the advantage of the Basic mode over Accurate? Personally I think it looks a bit strange since (I think?) most people (or at least me) prefer looking mostly at the center of the Godot window while working inside the scene editor, so Accurate mode showing the parallax in the center makes more sense, if my thinking makes sense.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3424875041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3427580488","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111832#issuecomment-3427580488","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111832","id":3427580488,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MTLpI","user":{"login":"markdibarry","id":21325943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI1OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21325943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry","html_url":"https://github.com/markdibarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T16:34:52Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T16:34:52Z","body":"All the amazing work goes to KoBeWi; I'm just adapting it with their permission!\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/KoBeWi/Godot-Parallax2D-Preview\r\n\r\nThe main difference, as they explain, at least, is the Accurate mode shows feedback as a rectangle that always encloses the full viewport in-game plus things around it. The Basic mode puts it at the top left corner as if the editor camera is the game camera. Perhaps it'd be better have more descriptive names.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3427580488/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3956184055","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111832#issuecomment-3956184055","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111832","id":3956184055,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rzpP3","user":{"login":"markdibarry","id":21325943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI1OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatar